<title>USA: Magellan Health holders okay Crescent deal.</title>
<headline>Magellan Health holders okay Crescent deal.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Magellan Health Services Inc said Friday its shareholders approved an asset sale and joint venture deal with Crescent Real Estate Equities Co.</p>
<p>The deal calls for Magellan to sell $400 million in assets related to 95 psychiatric hospital facitilies to Crescent and enter a 50/50 joint venture with a Crescent spin-off to operate the facilities covered under the sale.</p>
<p>Magellan, a behavioral health care provider, has three business units: Charter Behavioral Health Systems, Green Spring Health Services and Magellan Public Solutions.</p>
</text>
